    row1: 'All barrels are destroyed immediately on hit.<br>Apart from dropping normal
      loot, multiple bomblets scatter randomly from the destroyed barrel, dealing
      damage to both the player and enemies.<br>Damage of each bomblet is based on
      the current level and difficulty. Damage to the player is reduced by {4}.<br>Barrels
      scatter {0} bombs (Max extra bombs: {1}).<br>Grant {2} extra bomblet(s) for
      each {3} {5}'
