  - key: Item_Description_U_PlanarBinding
    row1: Adjacent Summon items gain {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}.
  - key: Item_Description_U_Queen_1
    row1: Adjacent weapons deal extra damage based on current amount of HP({DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0})<br>At
      100%HP bonus damage is doubled
  - key: Item_Description_U_RingOfThorn_1
    row1: Adjacent Melee Weapons gains {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}.<br>Adjacent Ranged
      Weapons gains {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@1@0}
  - key: Item_Description_U_Ring_1
    row1: 'Adjacent weapons gain bonus: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_Shackle_1
    row1: Adjacent weapons gain bonus {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}, if they are not adjacent
      to any other weapon.
  - key: Item_Description_U_TarnishedCrown_1
    row1: Adjacent weapons cause enemy to drop more gold when killed
  - key: Item_Description_U_TaxDemon
    row1: '{DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_Tentacle_1
    row1: 'Adjacent polearm items: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_Vial_1
    row1: Adjacent weapons gain {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}
  - key: Item_Description_U_YellowFeather_1
    row1: Adjacent weapons gains {RULE_ItemPowerUp0@0} Crit Modifier.
  - key: Item_Description_WP_DLC_HeartSeeker
    row1: Hunts down and pierces all enemies within the player's vicinity. Speed
      scales with Attack Speed.
  - key: Item_Description_WP_DLC_PoisonBottle
    row1: Leaves a trail of poison. Every adjacent DOT item increases poison trail
      duration by {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0}.<br>{DYNAMIC_POWERUP@1@0}
  - key: Item_Description_WP_DLC_RuneCarver
    row1: Plants an energy bomb at the player's feet. The energy bomb explodes after
      {SECONDARY_ProcDuration} seconds or when an enemy crosses it. Explosion AOE
      scales with Magic Power.
  - key: Item_Description_WP_U_AbyssalCleaver
    row1: '{DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}.<br>Adjacent Lifestealing items grant bonus {RULE_PowerUp@1@0}
      lifesteal.<br>{DYNAMIC_POWERUP@2@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_WP_U_BannerOfHeaven
    row1: A halberd with holy banner.<br>{DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}.<br>Adjacent weapons
      benefit from flat damage increase
  - key: Item_Description_WP_U_BuilderHand
    row1: 'Alternates between a sweep and a slam.<br>- Sweep: Massive knockback on
      enemies hit.<br>- Slam: 1.5x damage multiplier.<br>Adjacent Vitality items
      grant {RULE_PowerUp@0@0} Vitality. Adjacent Armor items gain {RULE_PowerUp@1@0}
      Armor.'
  - key: Item_Description_WP_U_DivinePunisher
    row1: '{DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}(resetting each floor).<br>After taking damage 5
      times, sword sets enemies on fire dealing damage based on Recovery.<br>Adjacent
      Blessed weapons gains {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@1@0}.<br>{DYNAMIC_POWERUP@2@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_WP_U_KnightOpener
    row1: Shot creates a large explosion on first impact, dealing {SECONDARY_SecondaryDamage}({ICON_ProjectilePower})
      damage<br>Subsequent pierces create a smaller explosions, dealing {THIRD_ThirdDamage}({ICON_ProjectilePower@ThirdDamage})
      damage<br>{RULE_ItemPowerUp0@0} Pierce for each adjacent Projectile Weapons
  - key: Item_Description_WP_U_Sovereignty
    row1: Gain {POWERUPS_ContextItem} whenever the player lifesteals<br>Increase
      {RULE_PowerUp0@0} Resource Gain for each adjacent Lifesteal Weapon<br>Adjacent
      Lifesteal Weapons grant {RULE_ItemPowerUp0@0} gold every time they lifesteal
  - key: Item_Description_WP_U_VorpalBlade
    row1: 'Normal enemy: Instantly killed on Crit<br>Boss and Elite: +100% Crit Damage<br>Gains
      {RULE_ItemPowerUp0@0} Critical Chance for each adjacent Dagger'
  - key: Item_Description_Wand4
    row1: Bring down divine judgement. Adjacent Recovery items grants {RULE_PowerUp@0@0}
      Recovery
