      {SECONDARY_SecondaryDamage} damage per stack. The closer the enemy, the more
      damage they take and the stronger the knockback. Has a {SECONDARY_ProjectilesChange}
      chance to fire a burst of explosive grenades<br>Reload after {SECONDARY_Projectiles}
      shots<br>Reload time: {SECONDARY_AttackSpeed}<br>Has a {SECONDARY_SecondaryProcChance}
      chance to summon an unit when killing an enemy'
