  - key: SummonUnit_Description_NatureElemental
    row1: A large tree that spreads its roots over a wide area<br>Enemies within
      the roots' area of effect are slowed by {SECONDARY_MoveSpeedReduced} and gain
      {STAT_AttackSpeedBase@NoSuffix} stack of {TERMS_Plague} per second<br>Whenever
      an enemy dies within the roots, there is a {SECONDARY_SecondaryProcChance}
      chance that all allies inside the area are healed for {STAT_Heal} ({ICON_TieredValueWithScaling@Heal})
  - key: Item_Description_HeavenSplitter
    row1: 'Attacks alternate between thrusts and slashes.<br>- Thrust: Fires a piercing
      bolt of lightning that applies {TERMS_Shock} to enemies hit.<br>- Slash: Calls
      down a bolt of lightning that applies {TERMS_Shock} to the area.<br>Has a {SECONDARY_SecondaryProcChance}
      chance to summon an unit when killing an enemy'
