  - key: Item_Description_AOE_Ring3
    row1: Gains {NATIVE_RESOLVER@0@PrimaryValue} and {NATIVE_RESOLVER@1@PrimaryValue}
      for each Automaton within {WEAPON_ActualRange} range
  - key: Item_Description_AOE_Ring4
    row1: '{TERMS_AuraOfDeath}: All enemies within the Aura take {WEAPON_ActualDamage}
      ({ICON_MagicPower@Primary}) per {WEAPON_ActualAttackSpeed}s. {NATIVE_RESOLVER@0}<EndLine>{NATIVE_RESOLVER@1}'
  - key: Item_Description_AlchemyLauncher
    row1: Throws flasks in an arc at a target location. Flasks impact after {SECONDARY_ProcDuration}
      seconds. Explode on impact, applying Plague Cloud to enemies hit. Adjacent
      weapons gain a {RULE_ItemPowerUp0@0} bonus to their area of effect
  - key: Item_Description_Amulet_4
    row1: An additional elite enemy spawns in every level
  - key: Item_Description_ArrowHead
    row1: '{POWERUP_Piece} Pierce for Projectile weapons'
  - key: Item_Description_Axe1
    row1: '{RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Attack Speed for each adjacent axe'
  - key: Item_Description_Axe2
    row1: '{RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0@BaseDamage} Base Damage for each adjacent Axe'
  - key: Item_Description_Axe3
    row1: '{RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Critical Damage for each adjacent axe'
  - key: Item_Description_Book2_Magic
    row1: 'Each wand in same rows or columns: {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Projectile'
  - key: Item_Description_Book4_Bounces
    row1: 'Each adjacent throwing weapon: {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Bounce'
  - key: Item_Description_BookOfFriends
    row1: '{RULE_PowerUp@0@0} Summon Quantity for each adjacent Summon item'
  - key: Item_Description_Boot_3
    row1: Add Fire Damage To Dash
  - key: Item_Description_Cannon
    row1: Projectile explodes on impact
  - key: Item_Description_Cleaver1
    row1: '{SECONDARY_ProcChance} chance to perform a downward strike attack, causing
      area of effect damage. <br>{RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} area of effect damage for
      each adjacent Armor. <br>{RULE_ItemPowerUp@1@0} Area of Effect increases for
      each adjacent Mighty Weapon'
  - key: Item_Description_Cold_Terms
    row1: '{TERMS_Cold}<br>Enemies'' movement speed is reduced by {SECONDARY_MoveSpeedReduced}'
  - key: Item_Description_CrateCaller
    row1: More Barrels Per Floor
  - key: Item_Description_CrossBow1
    row1: '{RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} (stacking) chance to shoot double projectile  for
      each adjacent Projectile weapons'
  - key: Item_Description_CrossBow2
    row1: Rapid-firing crossbow
  - key: Item_Description_CrossBow3
    row1: 'Adjacent Melee Weapons gains bonus: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_CrossBow4
    row1: Cooldown is {SECONDARY_AttackSpeed} after each 6 shots<br>Last hit is always
      critical and stronger, crit damage {SECONDARY_LastHitCriticalDamage}
  - key: Item_Description_CrossBow5
    row1: Adjacent Projectile weapons have {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} (stacking) chance
      to fire {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@1} identical projectile at nearby enemies on hit
  - key: Item_Description_CrossBow6
    row1: Projectile bounces {STAT_Bounce} times on hit<br>Bounce damage loss reduced
      to {SECONDARY_BounceDamageLoss}
  - key: Item_Description_CrossBow8
    row1: '{RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Pierce for each adjacent Range item.<br>Damage
      loss on pierce reduced to {SECONDARY_PierceDamageLossFixed}.'
  - key: Item_Description_CrossbowMinigun
    row1: Unleashes a storm of bolts
  - key: Item_Description_CrystalBall
    row1: '{RULE_PowerUp@0@0} Crit Chance for each adjacent Magic Power item'
  - key: Item_Description_Dagger1
    row1: '{RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Critical Chance for each adjacent Dagger'
  - key: Item_Description_Dagger2
    row1: '{STAT_DamageBonusPerKill} Damage every {ITEM_KillCountEnemy} kills with
      this weapon'
  - key: Item_Description_Dagger3
    row1: Lifesteal {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} if not placed near any other Lifestealing
      weapon
  - key: Item_Description_Dagger4
    row1: Adjacent weapons has an extra {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} to trigger lifesteal
      on kill
  - key: Item_Description_DualSword1
    row1: '{SECONDARY_BonusAttackSpeed} Attack Speed when not moving. Adjacent weapons
      benefit from the same bonus attack speed'
  - key: Item_Description_EyeInBottle
    row1: '{ELITE_Count} extra elite enemy spawns in every level'
  - key: Item_Description_Fist1
    row1: '{RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Critical Damage for each adjacent Fist'
  - key: Item_Description_Fist2
    row1: '{STAT_AttackSpeedBonusPerKill}% Attack Speed every {ITEM_KillCountAttackSpeed}
      kills with this weapon'
  - key: Item_Description_Fist4
    row1: Creates a cone-shaped explosion on impact. Enemies hit are launched extremely
      far
  - key: Item_Description_Flail1
    row1: Attack causes a burst of piercing spikes. Each spike deals {SECONDARY_SecondaryDamage}
      ({ICON_MeleePower}) damage
  - key: Item_Description_Glove_1
    row1: '{RULE_PowerUp@0@0} Crit Chance for each adjacent Glove'
  - key: Item_Description_GreatAxe1
    row1: '{SECONDARY_ProcChance} to perform a whirlwind attack. {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0}
      chance to perform a whirlwind attack for each adjacent axes.'
  - key: Item_Description_GreatHammer1
    row1: Attacks strike the ground, causing area-of-effect damage.<br>Increases
      AOE size by {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} for each adjacent Crushing weapon.
  - key: Item_Description_GreatSword1
    row1: '{RULE_PowerUp@0@0} Vitality for each adjacent sword'
  - key: Item_Description_Grimoire
    row1: '{RULE_PowerUp@0@0} Magic Power for each adjacent Enchanted Weapon'
  - key: Item_Description_Halberd1
    row1: Bonus {SECONDARY_BonusDamage} damage base while standing still. Adjacent
      armor items give {RULE_PowerUp@0@0} armor. {DYNAMIC_POWERUP}
  - key: Item_Description_Hammer1
    row1: Attacks strike the ground, causing area-of-effect damage.<br>Increases
      AOE size by {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} for each adjacent Crushing weapon.
  - key: Item_Description_Hat_1
    row1: '{RULE_PowerUp@0@0} INT for each adjacent wand or staff.'
  - key: Item_Description_Hat_2
    row1: '{RULE_PowerUp@0@0} INT for each adjacent wand or staff.'
  - key: Item_Description_HeavenSplitter
    row1: 'Attacks alternate between thrusts and slashes.<br>- Thrust: Fires a piercing
      bolt of lightning that applies {TERMS_Shock} to enemies hit.<br>- Slash: Calls
      down a bolt of lightning that applies {TERMS_Shock} to the area.<br>{Stat_SummonOnKillChance}
      chance to create a random summon when killing an enemy.'
  - key: Item_Description_HolyRelic
    row1: '{RULE_PowerUp@0@0} Recovery for every adjacent Blessed or Recovery item'
  - key: Item_Description_Lance1
    row1: Adjacent Movement items grant an extra {RULE_PowerUp@0@0} Movement Speed
  - key: Item_Description_MaatScale
    row1: '{NATIVE_RESOLVER@0}<br>Any adjustment made to Critical Chance will be
      converted to Critical Damage.<br>Non-crit attacks have a chance to become a
      {TERMS_Supercrit}'
  - key: Item_Description_MaatScale_InGame
    row1: 'Critical Damage: {INGAME_NATIVE_RESOLVER@1}'
  - key: Item_Description_Mace2
    row1: 'Adjacent Blessed weapons gains bonus: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_PlanarKey
    row1: Replaces the player's dash with Teleport.
  - key: Item_Description_Rapier2
    row1: Increases Crit Chance by {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} for each adjacent Lifesteal
      item.<br>Increases Crit Damage by {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@1} for each adjacent
      Lifesteal item.
  - key: Item_Description_Rune1
    row1: '{RULE_PowerUp@0@0} Melee Power for every adjacent Melee Weapon.<br>{RULE_PowerUp@1@0}
      Magic Power for every adjacent Enchanted Weapon.'
  - key: Item_Description_Scimitar1
    row1: '{SECONDARY_ProcChance} chance to spawn a blade of air when attack, dealing
      {SECONDARY_SecondaryDamage} ({ICON_MeleePower}) damage.'
  - key: Item_Description_Scythe1
    row1: '{RULE_PowerUp@0@0} Lifesteal for each adjacent Polearm'
  - key: Item_Description_Shield1
    row1: '{RULE_PowerUp@0@0} Armor for each adjacent weapon'
  - key: Item_Description_Shield4
    row1: Launches a wave of spike dealing damage {WEAPON_ActualDamage} ({ICON_Armor})
      damage when blocking
  - key: Item_Description_Sickle1
    row1: '{SECONDARY_BonusAttackSpeed} Attack Speed while moving'
  - key: Item_Description_Spear1
    row1: '{RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} range for each adjacent weapons'
  - key: Item_Description_Spear4
    row1: Attacks alternate between creating ice and lightning afterimages, dealing
      {SECONDARY_SecondaryDamage@BaseDamage} ({ICON_MagicPower@BaseDamage}) damage.<br>-
      Ice afterimages apply 1 stack of {TERMS_Cold}.<br>- Lightning afterimages apply
      1 stack of {TERMS_Shock}
  - key: Item_Description_Spear5
    row1: When hitting enemy, multiple tridents swarm from the ground around enemies
  - key: Item_Description_Staff1
    row1: Fire a beam of piercing magic. Adjacent Magic Power items grant {RULE_PowerUp@0@0}
      Magic power
  - key: Item_Description_Staff2
    row1: 'Adjacent Melee Weapons gains bonus: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_Staff4
    row1: Call forth a hail of ice
  - key: Item_Description_Summon_BoneGolem
    row1: Bone Golem's Slam AOE increases by an additional {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0}
      for each adjacent Magic Power item
  - key: Item_Description_Summon_FrostElemental
    row1: Adjacent Melee Power items grant an additional {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Melee
      Power.
  - key: Item_Description_Summon_PocketMortar
    row1: AOE of adjacent weapons and summons {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0}
  - key: Item_Description_Summon_PurifierLauncher
    row1: Adjacent Projectile Power items {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Projectile Power
  - key: Item_Description_Summon_RepairTower
    row1: Adjacent Recovery items {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Recovery
  - key: Item_Description_Summon_ScorpionTurret
    row1: Increases the range of adjacent Range items by an additional {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0}
  - key: Item_Description_Supercrit_Terms
    row1: '{TERMS_Supercrit}<br>Deal {CHARACTERSTATSCALING@SuperCritModifierScale}
      Critical Damage'
  - key: Item_Description_Sword1
    row1: Base damage increases by {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0@BaseDamage@NoPrefix} for
      every other sword in the inventory.
  - key: Item_Description_Sword2
    row1: 'Adjacent Armor: {RULE_PowerUp@0@0} Armor'
  - key: Item_Description_Throw2
    row1: Deals area-of-effect damage on impact
  - key: Item_Description_Throw3
    row1: Adjacent Throwing weapons gains bonus {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Bounce chance
  - key: Item_Description_Throw4
    row1: '{RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Attack speed for each adjacent Dagger'
  - key: Item_Description_Throw5
    row1: '{RULE_ItemPowerUp0@0} Crit chance for every adjacent Axe. Does full damage
      and pierces everything on Crit.<br>(Cannot bounce)'
  - key: Item_Description_U_AmuletSword_1
    row1: Adjacent Weapons gain {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0} Tag
  - key: Item_Description_U_AngelWing_1
    row1: 'Adjacent weapons gains the {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0} tag. Adjacent Blessed
      weapons: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@1}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_Antler_1
    row1: Adjacent weapons gain extra {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} attack speed
  - key: Item_Description_U_ArcaneGauntlet_1
    row1: Adjacent melee weapons deals extra damage based on magic power. Adjacent
      enchanted weapons deals extra damage based on melee power
  - key: Item_Description_U_ArrowShaft_1
    row1: 'Adjacent Projectile Weapons gains {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0} Pierce(Pierce
      Damage reduce 50% damage per hit). Adjacent Projectile Weapons gains: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_Bandolier_1
    row1: 'Adjacent weapons gain the Sharp Tag.<br>Adjacent weapons gain bonus: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@1@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_Banner_1
    row1: Adjacent Weapons give {RULE_PowerUp@0@0}  Armor. Adjacent Armor items give
      {RULE_PowerUp@1@0}  Melee Power
  - key: Item_Description_U_BatAmulet_1
    row1: Adjacent lifesteal items gain {RULE_PowerUp0@0} Lifesteal. Adjacent vitality
      items gain {RULE_PowerUp0@1} vitality.
  - key: Item_Description_U_BlackBone_1
    row1: Adjacent Enchanted weapons apply Lamb status on hit.
  - key: Item_Description_U_BookOfDemon_1
    row1: Adjacent Weapons reduce flat damage by {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@1}%. Adjacent
      weapons apply Curse status on hit. {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}. Curse slows the affected
      enemy.
  - key: Item_Description_U_BrokenBlade_1
    row1: 'Adjacent weapons: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_CallingCard_1
    row1: Adjacent weapons have a chance of giving gold on hit. Chance to give gold
      increases for each item that is not a weapon in the inventory.
  - key: Item_Description_U_Commandment_1
    row1: 'Adjacent armor gains {RULE_PowerUp@0@0} recovery<br>Adjacent Shields gain
      bonus: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@1@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_ConquerorFlag_1
    row1: 'Adjacent Armor: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_Crest_1
    row1: Adjacent melee weapons gain {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}
  - key: Item_Description_U_CrystalHeart_1
    row1: 'Adjacent Melee Weapons: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}<br>Adjacent Enchanted Weapons:
      {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@1@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_DarkLegionBanner
    row1: Adjacent Summon items gain {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}.
  - key: Item_Description_U_EmberStone_1
    row1: Adjacent Experience Gain items gain extra Experience gain
  - key: Item_Description_U_Fang_1
    row1: 'Adjacent weapons gain: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_HitList_1
    row1: Spawn a Marked enemy every floor. If there is an elite enemy, mark an elite
      instead. Killing a Marked enemy drops extra gold and a special potion that
      increases Melee Power
  - key: Item_Description_U_HorseShoe_1
    row1: 'Adjacent weapons gain: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_Laurel_1
    row1: 'Adjacent weapon: +1 tier (Max: Tier 4)'
  - key: Item_Description_U_Ledger_1
    row1: At the beginning of every floor, grant gold based on the total value of
      adjacent items
  - key: Item_Description_U_Ledger_1_InGame
    row1: 'Next paycheck: {INGAME_DynamicPowerUp@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_MagicAmulet_1
    row1: At the start of the floor, grant a shield that absorbs damage<br>{DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}
  - key: Item_Description_U_MagicAmulet_1_InGame
    row1: 'Shield Bonus: {INGAME_PowerUpStatID@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_MagicCompass_1
    row1: 'Adjacent Movement items: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_Mask_1
    row1: 'Adjacent weapons gain extra: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_PerpeptualCog
    row1: Adjacent Summon items gain {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}.
  - key: Item_Description_U_PlanarBinding
    row1: Adjacent Summon items gain {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}.
  - key: Item_Description_U_Queen_1
    row1: Adjacent weapons deal extra damage based on current amount of HP({DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0})<br>At
      100%HP bonus damage is doubled
  - key: Item_Description_U_RingOfThorn_1
    row1: Adjacent Melee Weapons gains {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}.<br>Adjacent Ranged
      Weapons gains {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@1@0}
  - key: Item_Description_U_Ring_1
    row1: 'Adjacent weapons gain bonus: {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}'
  - key: Item_Description_U_Shackle_1
    row1: Adjacent weapons gain bonus {DYNAMIC_POWERUP@0@0}, if they are not adjacent
