  - key: Item_Description_Fist3
    row1: Attacks apply {TERMS_Burn} to enemies, dealing {SECONDARY_SecondaryDamage}
      ({ICON_MagicPower}) damage for each stack.<br>Gain {SECONDARY_BonusAttackSpeed}
      Attack Speed when attacking enemies affected by {TERMS_Burn}.
  - key: Item_Description_Fist5
