      enemies struck.<br>Lightning Bolt's size increases by {RULE_ItemPowerUp@0@0}
      for each adjacent Polearm weapon.
  - key: Item_Description_Wand2
    row1: Shoots three fire bolts that deal {SECONDARY_SecondaryDamage} ({ICON_MagicPower})
      burning damage for each stack and apply {TERMS_Burn}.
  - key: Item_Description_Wand3
    row1: Attacks with lightning bolts that bounce {SECONDARY_ProcAmount} times,
